 is still on the left. Screenshot it (F12) and post it in the Discussions thread \"Next Fest Challenge\". Every fight shows its HP cost before you start, and nothing is random. That means the route decides the result: which door you open, which upgrade you buy a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696493","verified_at":"2026-10-21T08:28:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4860450-1845383656375826","game_id":"steam-4860450","kind":"announcement","title":"TowerBound’s free demo is live — climb the first 10 floors","summary":"The free TowerBound demo is live on Steam. Climb the first ten floors of a hand-crafted, 50-floor puzzle-RPG inspired by the Magic Tower tradition. There are no dice rolls or random encounters. You can see what every fight will cost before committing; the puzzle is deciding which enemies to fight, which doors to open, and when to spend your HP, keys, and gold. The demo is playable in English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, and Traditional Chinese. TowerBound is also participating in Steam Next Fe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T23:43:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656375826","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4860450":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:10Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:09Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4860450":"2026-10-26T14:52:10Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4860450":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:09Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:09Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:09Z"},"5024630":